<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Forgot Password | <%= libraryName %></title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo.jpg" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>
<body style="background:var(--bg);min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px 16px;">

  <div style="width:100%;max-width:440px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);overflow:hidden;">
    
    <div style="padding:32px 24px 20px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fafc 0%,#ffffff 100%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
      <div style="width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:14px;background:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;margin:0 auto 12px;">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i>
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:20px;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:4px;font-weight:800;">Password Assistance</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:13.5px;margin:0;">Reset your <%= libraryName %> account access</p>
    </div>

    <div style="padding:28px 24px;">
      <div class="card" style="padding:18px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;margin-bottom:20px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:15px;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info" style="color:var(--primary);"></i> How to reset your password:
        </h3>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:12px;">
          For physical library security, passwords can be quickly reset by the library manager at the counter or by reaching out to support.
        </p>
        <div style="background:#ffffff;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:13px;color:var(--text-primary);">
          <div>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +91 8103485288 / 7987526720</div>
          <div style="margin-top:4px;">💬 <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +91 8103485288</div>
          <div style="margin-top:4px;">📍 <strong>Desk:</strong> Visit the front desk with your Student ID</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="https://wa.me/918103485288?text=Hello%20SR%20Library,%20I%20need%20help%20resetting%20my%20student%20account%20password." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" style="width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px;">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp"></i> Contact Desk on WhatsApp
      </a>

      <a href="/student/login" class="btn btn-ghost btn-block" style="width:100%;padding:11px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;display:block;">
        ← Back to Student Login
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
